  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Krali\xE7esi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nHerkesin belli bir maddi g\xFCc\xFC vard\u0131r ve harcamalar
    bu do\u011Frultuda yap\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r, bunu sen de biliyorsun {{isim}}.
    Ancak se\xE7mi\u015F oldu\u011Fun kart, l\xFCks ya\u015Famak ad\u0131na giderlerini
    kontrol etmedi\u011Fini, harcamalar\u0131nda a\u015F\u0131r\u0131ya ka\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    ve kendi kendini s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131ya soktu\u011Funu anlat\u0131yor. \u0130htiya\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131
    s\u0131raya sokmadan, eline ge\xE7en her f\u0131rsatta kafana koydu\u011Fun her
    \u015Feyi bir anda edinmeye \xE7al\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Prestij
    elde etmek isterken, seni gelece\u011Fe g\xFCvenle ta\u015F\u0131yacak ekonomik
    plan ve programdan sapm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. G\xFCvendi\u011Fin \u015Feyler de
    varm\u0131\u015F elbette; belki ailen, belki dostlar\u0131n, belki de sevdi\u011Fin
    ve seni yar\u0131 yolda b\u0131rakmayacaklar\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    birka\xE7 ki\u015Fi. Sonu\xE7ta, insan\u0131n kendi g\xF6be\u011Fini her zaman
    kendi kesmeye haz\u0131r olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011Fini \xF6\u011Frenmi\u015Fsin."
